{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-3","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例论","englishTitle":"If a first magnitude be the same multiple of a second that a third is of a fourth, and if equimultiples be taken of the first and third, then also ex aequali the magnitudes taken will be equimultiples respectively, the one of the second and the other of the fourth.","book":5,"number":3,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.3","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.3/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":3,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-3@raw-34da194bd0ce7365","contentId":"euclid-5-3","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34da194bd0ce73658bfa61b355037e3e1a6581aad655b2c20c00532c283eea93","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-3.statement","euclid-5-3.construction.1","euclid-5-3.proof.1","euclid-5-3.construction.2","euclid-5-3.proof.2","euclid-5-3.proof.3","euclid-5-3.proof.4","euclid-5-3.proof.5","euclid-5-3.conclusion","euclid-5-3.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-3.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-3","revisionId":"euclid-5-3@raw-34da194bd0ce7365","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4d3944806953ba6ce910b6f6e981ec7795818ed6a7a1d7c818850d5fd45f6e7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a first magnitude be the same multiple of a second that a third is of a fourth, and if equimultiples be taken of the first and third, then also ex aequali the magnitudes taken will be equimultiples respectively, the one of the second and the other of the fourth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果第一个星等的乘数与第二个星等的乘数相同,如果第三个星等的乘数等于第四个星等,如果第一个和第三个星等的乘数为同倍数,那么所测的星等将分别为同倍数,第二个星等和第四个星等的乘数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-3.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-3","revisionId":"euclid-5-3@raw-34da194bd0ce7365","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d32c575022861f2e1e855e2abe3edfdb98826d346cf4c3c856931d5e6c862e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a first magnitude A be the same multiple of a second B that a third C is of a fourth D, and let equimultiples EF, GH be taken of A, C; I say that EF is the same multiple of B that GH is of D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"一级A是第二个B的倍数,第三个C是第四个D, 使同倍数 EF,GH是A,C;我说,EF是B的倍数,GH是D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-3.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-3","revisionId":"euclid-5-3@raw-34da194bd0ce7365","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a09f88be827f48acf69051ce0922a7cca2442fa59ac7d0b7cf218961095ad9a9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since EF is the same multiple of A that GH is of C, therefore, as many magnitudes as there are in EF equal to A, so many also are there in GH equal to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为EF是A的倍数,GH是C,因此,EF的数值等于A,A的数值也等于C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-3.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-5-3","revisionId":"euclid-5-3@raw-34da194bd0ce7365","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34c99cffb7cc17faa8c2a1d8c31186b23fbfbf6aa3bdd666f5aa20f55d2fa0a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let EF be divided into the magnitudes EK, KF equal to A, and GH into the magnitudes GL, LH equal to C; then the multitude of the magnitudes EK, KF will be equal to the multitude of the magnitudes GL, LH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让EF分为EK、KF等于A,GH分为GL、LH等于C;那么,EK、KF等的数将等于GL、LH等的数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-3.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-3","revisionId":"euclid-5-3@raw-34da194bd0ce7365","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9aff8c91b95232d4f9b34bc7ac22a16ce27ef306b96d68c86cd18e5d9750cbf5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A is the same multiple of B that C is of D, while EK is equal to A, and GL to C, therefore EK is the same multiple of B that GL is of D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A是B的乘数,C是D,EK等于A,GL是C,EK是B,GL是D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-3.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-3","revisionId":"euclid-5-3@raw-34da194bd0ce7365","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aabf26c2c268625f07525d3f8a0bb36c2ada0b846bc1fc7c8d727df8fa8156e5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"也因为同样的原因"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-3.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-3","revisionId":"euclid-5-3@raw-34da194bd0ce7365","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6fe22d5d7d87f5e9f0b329fb15774708ac4712ba5e12ed975068c79a97d671b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"KF is the same multiple of B that LH is of D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"KF是B的乘数,LH是D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-3.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-3","revisionId":"euclid-5-3@raw-34da194bd0ce7365","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b6b66f9d6f6a091cd68304d7442e7616c5b1e3288ee1161f281254e7883c41e","citations":["euclid-5-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, a first magnitude EK is the same multiple of a second B that a third GL is of a fourth D, and a fifth KF is also the same multiple of the second B that a sixth LH is of the fourth D, therefore the sum of the first and fifth, EF, is also the same multiple of the second B that the sum of the third and sixth, GH, is of the fourth D. [[V. 2](/principles/euclid-5-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,第一级EK是第二一级B的乘数,第三级GL是第四级D,而第五级KF也是第二级B的乘数,第六级LH是第四级D,因此,第一和第二级EF的乘数与第三级和第六级GH的乘数相同。 [[V. 2](/principles/euclid-5-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-3.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-3","revisionId":"euclid-5-3@raw-34da194bd0ce7365","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-3.source","contentId":"euclid-5-3","revisionId":"euclid-5-3@raw-34da194bd0ce7365","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"518b46e06b3846781f67edfbec03bf2a3c366d9c170c4750c46b1a542d2bf7fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.3/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.3\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-3:euclid-5-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-3.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"V. 2"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-4:euclid-5-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-4.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"V. 3"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-3:euclid-5-2:explicit","id":"euclid-5-2","book":5,"number":2,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例论","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-4:euclid-5-3:explicit","id":"euclid-5-4","book":5,"number":4,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
